(7659895, 1247838, 144365, '<td valign="top">My top choice, but I couldn''t give it top marks. <br/>The two different light source reflected in the surface of the vase bother me. I would have screened the overhead light in the room. Their yellow colour takes away from the window. And it looks like you''re standing in the way of the window as well. <br/> <br/>I know this is minimal, but those things could be easily rectified with a little work.</td>', 'My top choice, but I couldn''t give it top marks. The two different light source reflected in the surface of the vase bother me. I would have screened the overhead light in the room. Their yellow colour takes away from the window. And it looks like you''re standing in the way of the window as well.  I know this is minimal, but those things could be easily rectified with a little work.', '2020-04-23 20:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
